		"content": {
			"start": 7,
			"end": 377,
			"styles": "\n\t/* Long nested selector list in :where() - wraps when exceeding print width */\n\tdiv:where(\n\t\t.class1,\n\t\t.class2,\n\t\t.class3,\n\t\t.class4,\n\t\t.class5,\n\t\t.class6,\n\t\t.class7,\n\t\t.class8,\n\t\t.class9,\n\t\t.class10\n\t) {\n\t\tcolor: red;\n\t}\n\n\t/* Long nested selector list in :is() - stays inline (under 100 chars) */\n\tspan:is(.a, .b, .c, .d, .e, .f, .g, .h, .i, .j) {\n\t\tcolor: blue;\n\t}\n",
			"comment": null
		}
